OL,3,ASongs created by AI banned from
OL,4,AAustralia's music charts
OL,5,
OL,6,FSongs that are largely or wholly
OL,7,Fcreated by AI have been banned from
OL,8,FAustralia's music charts.
OL,10,FFrom this week, all releases must be
OL,11,F"substantially human made" to be
OL,12,Feligible.
OL,14,FThe Australian Recording Industry
OL,15,FAssociation (ARIA) said the new code
OL,16,Fwould help "promote the human nature of
OL,17,Fartistry".
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,164,160,200,105,0,100
