OL,3,ASongs created by AI banned from
OL,4,AAustralia's music charts
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt follows a controversy around a cover
OL,7,Fof Madonna's Like A Prayer by
OL,8,FAustralian DJ Josh Fawaz which recently
OL,9,Ftopped the ARIA dance singles chart and
OL,10,Fpeaked at number 2 on the country's
OL,11,Foverall chart.
